{"id":"ec822da63d54930d","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-bessel.md","title":"Bessel Function","display":"df-bessel — Bessel Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bessel","aliases":["58-df-bessel","Bessel Function","Bessel Equation"],"display":"df-bessel — Bessel Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-ode]]","[[58-df-fourier-series]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bessel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bessel</span><span>Bessel Function</span><span>Bessel Equation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bessel — Bessel Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"31710fa05b4ffe92\" href=\"?note=31710fa05b4ffe92\" title=\"58-df-ode\">58-df-ode</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"923ca3856ded4fd3\" href=\"?note=923ca3856ded4fd3\" title=\"58-df-fourier-series\">58-df-fourier-series</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>, and order-indexed families <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J,Y:\\mathbb C\\times\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(J,Y:\\mathbb C\\times\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_\\mu(x):=J(\\mu,x)\">\\(J_\\mu(x):=J(\\mu,x)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_\\mu(x):=Y(\\mu,x)\">\\(Y_\\mu(x):=Y(\\mu,x)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> (Euler gamma function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BesselSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BesselSystem}_S\\)</span> (Bessel-system predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bessel} \\vdash \\mathrm{BesselSystem}_S(J,Y,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\nu\\in\\mathbb C\\land J,Y\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C\\times\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl(x^2J_\\nu&#39;&#39;(x)+xJ_\\nu&#39;(x)+(x^2-\\nu^2)J_\\nu(x)=0\\land x^2Y_\\nu&#39;&#39;(x)+xY_\\nu&#39;(x)+(x^2-\\nu^2)Y_\\nu(x)=0\\land J_\\nu(x)=\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{(-1)^k}{k!\\,\\Gamma(k+\\nu+1)}\\left(\\frac{x}{2}\\right)^{2k+\\nu}\\land\\bigl(\\nu\\notin\\mathbb Z\\to Y_\\nu(x)=\\frac{J_\\nu(x)\\cos(\\nu\\pi)-J_{-\\nu}(x)}{\\sin(\\nu\\pi)}\\bigr)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\\nu=n\\to Y_n(x)=\\lim_{\\mu\\to n}\\frac{J_\\mu(x)\\cos(\\mu\\pi)-J_{-\\mu}(x)}{\\sin(\\mu\\pi)}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bessel} \\vdash \\mathrm{BesselSystem}_S(J,Y,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\nu\\in\\mathbb C\\land J,Y\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C\\times\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl(x^2J_\\nu&#39;&#39;(x)+xJ_\\nu&#39;(x)+(x^2-\\nu^2)J_\\nu(x)=0\\land x^2Y_\\nu&#39;&#39;(x)+xY_\\nu&#39;(x)+(x^2-\\nu^2)Y_\\nu(x)=0\\land J_\\nu(x)=\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{(-1)^k}{k!\\,\\Gamma(k+\\nu+1)}\\left(\\frac{x}{2}\\right)^{2k+\\nu}\\land\\bigl(\\nu\\notin\\mathbb Z\\to Y_\\nu(x)=\\frac{J_\\nu(x)\\cos(\\nu\\pi)-J_{-\\nu}(x)}{\\sin(\\nu\\pi)}\\bigr)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\\nu=n\\to Y_n(x)=\\lim_{\\mu\\to n}\\frac{J_\\mu(x)\\cos(\\mu\\pi)-J_{-\\mu}(x)}{\\sin(\\mu\\pi)}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_\\nu\">\\(J_\\nu\\)</span>: Bessel function of first kind</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_\\nu\">\\(Y_\\nu\\)</span>: Bessel function of second kind</li>\n<li>Integer orders are defined by the parameter limit, avoiding division by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sin(\\nu\\pi)=0\">\\(\\sin(\\nu\\pi)=0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Spherical Bessel: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_n(x) = \\sqrt{\\pi/(2x)}J_{n+1/2}(x)\">\\(j_n(x) = \\sqrt{\\pi/(2x)}J_{n+1/2}(x)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Asymptotic: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_\\nu(x) \\sim \\sqrt{2/(\\pi x)} \\cos(x - \\nu\\pi/2 - \\pi/4)\">\\(J_\\nu(x) \\sim \\sqrt{2/(\\pi x)} \\cos(x - \\nu\\pi/2 - \\pi/4)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Watson, A Treatise on the Theory of Bessel Functions</li>\n<li>Lebedev, Special Functions and Their Applications</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ode","status":"resolved","id":"31710fa05b4ffe92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ode]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-fourier-series","status":"resolved","id":"923ca3856ded4fd3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-fourier-series]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\nu\\in\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"J,Y:\\mathbb C\\times\\mathbb R_{>0}\\to\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"J_\\mu(x):=J(\\mu,x)","display":false},{"tex":"Y_\\mu(x):=Y(\\mu,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BesselSystem}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bessel} \\vdash \\mathrm{BesselSystem}_S(J,Y,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\nu\\in\\mathbb C\\land J,Y\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C\\times\\mathbb R_{>0}}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\Bigl(x^2J_\\nu''(x)+xJ_\\nu'(x)+(x^2-\\nu^2)J_\\nu(x)=0\\land x^2Y_\\nu''(x)+xY_\\nu'(x)+(x^2-\\nu^2)Y_\\nu(x)=0\\land J_\\nu(x)=\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{(-1)^k}{k!\\,\\Gamma(k+\\nu+1)}\\left(\\frac{x}{2}\\right)^{2k+\\nu}\\land\\bigl(\\nu\\notin\\mathbb Z\\to Y_\\nu(x)=\\frac{J_\\nu(x)\\cos(\\nu\\pi)-J_{-\\nu}(x)}{\\sin(\\nu\\pi)}\\bigr)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\\nu=n\\to Y_n(x)=\\lim_{\\mu\\to n}\\frac{J_\\mu(x)\\cos(\\mu\\pi)-J_{-\\mu}(x)}{\\sin(\\mu\\pi)}\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"J_\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"Y_\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\sin(\\nu\\pi)=0","display":false},{"tex":"j_n(x) = \\sqrt{\\pi/(2x)}J_{n+1/2}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"J_\\nu(x) \\sim \\sqrt{2/(\\pi x)} \\cos(x - \\nu\\pi/2 - \\pi/4)","display":false}],"bytes":1658,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-bessel.md|58-df-bessel]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["31710fa05b4ffe92","923ca3856ded4fd3"]}